#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""usage-bar Touch Bar renderer for t1bridge.

One renderer that keeps everything t1bridge's built-in bar does on a machine
with no desktop provider (Esc, Fn for F1-F12, display and keyboard-backlight
steps with hold-to-repeat, the Touch ID overlay and its cancel), and draws
your Claude Code usage in the free right-hand half while a terminal is focused.

Protocol: t1bridge docs/interfaces.md (T1HW over /run/t1bridge/touchbar.sock).
A bug in this file exits the process so t1bridge falls back to its built-in
renderer; a lost or revoked connection is retried with backoff, like the
built-in one.
"""

